{
  "title": "Namaz of Sundays",
  "data": "Imam al-Hasan al-Askari (a.s.) is reported to have said that whoever offers on Sundays a four unit prayer; reciting in each unit [Surah al-Faatehah](A5) and [Surah al-Mulk](A71), will be allowed by Almighty Allah to occupy any place in Paradise he likes."
}
